      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While not solving the issue you can do two things here. Having the website open will put the invite link in your messages there for as long as you have the site open and thus you can accept it there when you are ready even if you cant see it in game anymore. Alternatively in game you can open the invite request and as long as you dont move or open a menu you have unlimited time to accept while the accept/decline menu is in your hand so you can continue talking to anyone around you.\nI get the feeling that with the new UI update it should act more like the website so it hopefully will remain indefinitely.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
