  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-01-06T03:18:31.138Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Invites is a great feature! But it disappears too quickly.\nI often get an invite from a friend. But before I can say bye to everyone and click the invite, it has already disappeared!\nPlease greatly increase the amount of time before an invite disappears. It’s probably just a matter of a programmer changing a number, right?",
